  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Psychic energy erupts at a point within range. Each creature in a 20-foot-radius Sphere centered on that point makes an Intelligence saving throw, taking 8d6 Psychic damage on a failure or half as much on a success.</p><p>A creature that fails also has muddled thoughts for 1 minute: it subtracts 1d6 from its attack rolls and ability checks, and from its Constitution saving throws to maintain Concentration. It makes an Intelligence saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.</p>",
